    Without automatic minor upgrades, a published engine patch is applied
    only when someone remembers to schedule it.
  RATIONALE

  desc 'check', <<~CHECK
    Checkov looks for: aws_db_instance: auto_minor_version_upgrade is True;
    aws_rds_cluster_instance: auto_minor_version_upgrade is True
